---
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Neural Napper Company // v0.9 beta</p>
    <h1>Your AI <span class="neon">nods</span>.<br />You <span class="neon-pink">sleep</span>.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Neural Napper joins your video calls, nods at exactly the right moments, murmurs a
      thoughtful "mm, totally" and delivers clean notes to your inbox — all while you're
      face-down in a pillow.
    </p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a href="/#waitlist" class="btn">Join the waitlist</a>
      <a href="/features" class="btn btn-ghost">See the features</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="stats mono">
      <li><strong class="neon">41,208</strong><span>meetings survived</span></li>
      <li><strong class="neon">7.4h</strong><span>sleep per workday</span></li>
      <li><strong class="neon">0</strong><span>coworkers suspicious</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero { padding: 6.5rem 0 5rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: 106px; }
  .hero::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: -40%;
    width: 120vw;
    height: 60vh;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.16), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .cta { display: flex; gap: 0.9rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 2rem 0 0; }
  .stats {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    gap: 2.6rem;
    padding: 2.6rem 0 0;
    margin: 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .stats li { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .stats strong { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.7rem; }
  .stats span {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
